{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37454","headline":"西明寺威公盆池新稻 · 唐彦谦","name":"西明寺威公盆池新稻","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"爲笑江南种稻时，露蝉鸣後雨霏霏。\n莲盆积润分畦小，藻井垂阴擢秀稀。\n得地又生金象界，结根仍对水田衣。\n支公尚有三吴思，更使幽人忆钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐彦谦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37454.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37454","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}